    "text": "Let G be a finite p-group of maximal class such that all its irreducible charac-\nters are induced from linear characters of normal subgroups. Let S be the set of the\nderived subgroups of the members of the central series of G. Is there a logarithmic\nbound for the derived length of G in terms of |S|?                         T. M. Keller",
